  <!-- EN: solus -->
  <APM_Solus.label>索拉斯</APM_Solus.label>
  <!-- EN: A reinforced gamma-ray emitter capable of producing a dense, concentrated ball of destructive energy. As the ball passes by targets, it discharges into them and ignites its surroundings. It is a particularly devastating weapon against groups of enemies. The massive energy output requires stabilization protocols to prevent self-damage. -->
  <APM_Solus.description>一台經過強化的伽馬射線發射器，能夠產生緻密且高度集中的毀滅性能量球。能量球掠過目標時會向其放電並點燃周圍環境。它是對付成群敵人的極具毀滅性的武器。巨大的能量輸出需要穩定協議來防止自傷。</APM_Solus.description>

  <!-- EN: solus orb -->
  <APM_SolusOrb.label>索拉斯寶珠</APM_SolusOrb.label>

</LanguageData>
